  # drift-ignore: gemini/gemini-4-neon -- paid only: "ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing" (read 2026-11-21) says "Gemini 4 Neon is not available on the Free tier" and gives "Not available" in its Free Tier column for input and output, which are $3.00 in / $15.00 out per million tokens
